### Variables de entorno
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/files
# Reemplazar con el token obtenido en tu endpoint de /auth/login
@authToken= eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..QvzjykyTbilrAWfWBP7TwaB-BeIqyGCvkOshtvPoA48

@authToken2= eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..CpjYqJQZIcUEvr-digZOu8nMLr4_9Gf_o4RUEexFNDc
# Reemplazar con el ID devuelto en la respuesta del upload:
@uuidName = 9a1000f8-97ee-4ad7-8046-ef47c1383514


### 1. Subir archivo de texto (test.txt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./test.txt
--WebAppBoundary--


### Subir imagen PNG (despliegue.png)
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="despliegue.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./despliegue.png
--WebAppBoundary--


### Subir archivo PDF (Mantenimiento.pdf)
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Mantenimiento.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./Mantenimiento.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--


### Subir HTML (presupuesto.html)
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="presupuesto.html"
Content-Type: text/html

< ./presupuesto.html
--WebAppBoundary--


### Subir Imagen JPEG (imagen.jpeg)
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="imagen.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./imagen.jpeg
