### Subir Planilla Excel (planilla.xlsx)
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="planilla.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./planilla.xlsx
--WebAppBoundary--


### Subir Video MP4 (video.mp4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="video.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./video.mp4
--WebAppBoundary--


### 2. Listar todos los archivos del usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 3. Descargar / Visualizar archivo por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{uuidName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 4. Eliminar archivo por ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{uuidName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}